cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, theoretical model, or dataset in your research, please cite both the software repository and the foundational preprint."
title: "High-Throughput Combinatorial Screening Pipeline for Refractory Bulk Metallic Glasses"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python analytical engine and screening pipeline coupling
  first-principles screened nuclear ion affinities (A_i), Rose Universal Binding
  Energy Relations (UBER), Voigt-Reuss-Hill continuum homogenization, and the
  Johnson-Samwer Cooperative Shear Model (CSM) to predict macroscopic elastic moduli
  and glass transition temperatures (T_g) for extreme-environment fusion Capillary
  Porous Systems (CPS).
